      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are really good questions. All vendor module do not have upstream path, so upstream does not agree for patches. \n\nThere was documentation on the exporting symbols from Google- \n\n\nExporting symbols via EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL()\nDo not send patches upstream that contain only symbol exports. To be considered for\nupstream Linux, additions of EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL() require an in-tree modular driver that uses\nthe symbol, so include the new driver or changes to an existing driver in the same patchset as\nthe export.",
