      "side": 1,
      "message": "What vendor module has been submitted upstream that they did not take?  I\u0027ll be glad to help get things merged properly, just point me at the kernel module source!\n\nYou will have another year before this tree is used by any vendor if Android continues to do releases based on LTS kernels, so exporting a symbol now feels odd.\n\n\u003cPrasad\u003e  Hi Greg, Thanks for offering help on this. \nThese are tons of downstream use cases and Qualcomm have no plans to upstream.  These are Qualcomm value adds and custom use case and they never get up-streamed as per my knowledge(based on earlier internal discussions). These all changes help to debug issues from filed and OEMS and upstream maintainers say that, they don’t have such use cases.  Due to GKI, we are structuring the code and looking for these symbols export.",
