      "writtenOn": "2020-12-22T20:00:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upstream takes all use cases, there is no such thing as \"custom\" ones, because everyone contributes in a selfish manner.  If you have one user, great, we will take your driver for it, that\u0027s the way it\u0027s always been so please, submit your modules or point me at them and I will be glad to do it for you.\n\nThe kernel is a commodity, not a place for differentiation.\n\nDo you have a link to the source for these modules?  I\u0027d be glad to review them and merge them upstream for the next kernel release.",
